l,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-06-13T09:20:39Z","updated_at":"2025-09-21T17:13:28Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:50:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107481","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107481","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107481.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107481.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-18T17:50:29Z"},"body":"`Node3D` maintains its own list of `Node3D`-only children (separate from the `Node`), in order to (in theory) make child iteration faster for only node3d children. The same happens with `CanvasItem` and `CanvasItem` children.\r\n\r\nThe problem is that these lists are stored as a linked list, and there is no reason to require linked list. Linked lists are bad for cache.\r\n\r\nForward port of #107480\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n(See 3.x PR, but gains should be similar in 4.x)\r\n_before:_ 157 fps\r\n_after:_ 280 fps\r\n\r\nThe benchmark creates a large number of `Node3D` children to the root node, then rotates the root. This stresses the `_propagate_transform_changed()` which utilizes the children list.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n* This is actually a no brainer, I also tested removing the `Node3D` children list entirely and utilizing the `Node` children list instead with fast casting, but this PR is still faster (because of no need for cast checks).\r\n* Some `NULL` checks in the original were redundant, I don't think these pointers can be `NULL` given the code here. \r\n* I may end up being able to use this list for `SceneTreeFTI` now it is faster, instead of `Node` children. Not 100% on this yet, but worth looking into.\r\n* Have done the same for `CanvasItem`, the same applies.\r\n* I've done testing on startup / shutdown times, and as expected there's no significant difference.\r\n\r\n## Additional\r\nThese lists are similar in 3.x and 4.x. Unlike the `Node` children list, they are unordered, so no need to change when rearranging children, only when entering / exiting tree, and removing items is O(1) rather than O(N).\r\n\r\nInstead of relying on the ability of linked list to remove an element fast, we use `remove_at_unordered` to remove elements in O(1). With linear lists, and keeping an ID of which child we are in the parent list, we have to rejig the child that is moved during `remove_at_unordered()`, and reassign its child ID. That should be the only thing required to keep the IDs in sync.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107481/reactions","total_count":22,"+1":12,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":7,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107481/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}